              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryaje kuri Hoseya mwene Beyeri, ku ngoma ya Uziya no ku ya Yotamu no ku ya Ahazi no ku ya Hezekiya, abami b’i Buyuda, hāri no ku ngoma ya Yerobowamu mwene Yehowasi, umwami w’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
